Package: vespa
Title: Mesh Transformations Using 'Vespa' 'VTK/CGAL' Mesh Processing Library
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Christophe", "Regouby", role = c("aut", "cph", "cre"), email = "christophe.regouby@free.fr")
Description: Provides R wrappers for all 'Vespa' 3D mesh filters (isotropic re-meshing, boolean operations, alpha wrapping,
            surface reconstruction, point set processing, as-rigid-as-possible deformation and more) via direct 'Rcpp' bindings
            to the 'Vespa C++' 'VTK/CGAL' library. Also includes a very fast 'STL' and 'VTP' file reader.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: VTK >= 9.4, CGAL >= 5.5, vespa >= 1.1
Imports:
    cli,
    Rcpp,
    rlang,
    sf
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rgl,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tictoc
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
